  "description": "Sanho suddenly finds herself as the academy’s only commoner after her school transforms into the world of a romance fantasy novel. Armed with memories of reality, she’s thrown into chaos when a strange mission appears: win over three potential male leads and uncover the truth behind this altered world. Amid dazzling nobles and hidden dangers, can Sanho complete her mission and face the secrets waiting for her?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
